    {
      "index": 0,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Robert Greene",
      "body": "See the position before the move. Keep the move inside the law.",
      "prev": "",
      "hash": "3b8a219ff231a7d7b45f657df5b4c5e15028cb1a361d50fad2bd85ba2a101885"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "The 50th Law",
      "body": "Name the fear, then take the move that fear was blocking.",
      "prev": "3b8a219ff231a7d7b45f657df5b4c5e15028cb1a361d50fad2bd85ba2a101885",
      "hash": "9d5db1e51ddb5d3663a05ac85e029c63e26950a5f1ceb88bdf63e1a0b9afd713"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "50 Cent",
      "body": "The profile is the mogul: vision, ground, contacts, and a long game.",
      "prev": "9d5db1e51ddb5d3663a05ac85e029c63e26950a5f1ceb88bdf63e1a0b9afd713",
      "hash": "7590c22c2fae9d6d6df239587b77150db85f6d1e9a6275709e821293fd80a479"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "strategy",
      "body": "One aim, the shorter path, and the reply it opens.",
      "prev": "7590c22c2fae9d6d6df239587b77150db85f6d1e9a6275709e821293fd80a479",
      "hash": "3765c9a0f859f7c3e15ecafa4fe4bb898f1377f01e04f91cf6ed72dd305eaf99"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "law",
      "body": "The checklist is already written. A failed gesture retrains the agent.",
      "prev": "3765c9a0f859f7c3e15ecafa4fe4bb898f1377f01e04f91cf6ed72dd305eaf99",
      "hash": "ff5fef82138e559801a265720a44c48b6c7f1bd9a5e2acca2d93e324be3ab3dd"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "business",
      "body": "One offer, one measure, then the next step.",
      "prev": "ff5fef82138e559801a265720a44c48b6c7f1bd9a5e2acca2d93e324be3ab3dd",
      "hash": "0c477435951fddeb509d3adf95b5d8ebaeadb43dc66a98db346b58bf1128d422"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "The Lean Startup",
      "body": "State the bet, measure it, then keep or cut it.",
      "prev": "0c477435951fddeb509d3adf95b5d8ebaeadb43dc66a98db346b58bf1128d422",
      "hash": "9a4637cb549f94a6060c32fa5a42f8ac569f6c6c4018d7720262320992264056"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Good to Great",
      "body": "Name the one thing this body can be best at, and stop the rest.",
      "prev": "9a4637cb549f94a6060c32fa5a42f8ac569f6c6c4018d7720262320992264056",
      "hash": "5d26c693c7f9813d91c3008cf1ec91f04333deda95c9a0720cafa9f3aab258a2"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Zero to One",
      "body": "Build a step nobody else has, then defend it.",
      "prev": "5d26c693c7f9813d91c3008cf1ec91f04333deda95c9a0720cafa9f3aab258a2",
      "hash": "dc637cb1e5fb01f67ede1815e63022352c2f4b1b0589b669b90ab7b87c182b81"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Competitive Strategy",
      "body": "Know the field, the cost, and the position before the price.",
      "prev": "dc637cb1e5fb01f67ede1815e63022352c2f4b1b0589b669b90ab7b87c182b81",
      "hash": "898784a76d92f1bbb93e90ff1e2a33e391ce7441313c93011ec2d322002fbc93"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Profit First",
      "body": "Set the margin aside before the spend.",
      "prev": "898784a76d92f1bbb93e90ff1e2a33e391ce7441313c93011ec2d322002fbc93",
      "hash": "e2331859973c88ec77c7e37cd099c728da8f980484b19f777120850036b3e2fe"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "college",
      "body": "Study the structure until the agent can say it.",
      "prev": "e2331859973c88ec77c7e37cd099c728da8f980484b19f777120850036b3e2fe",
      "hash": "bee56c2a7fc3b451085378c655cab25704ccc2c7add24bedd12c3394630b7757"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "streets",
      "body": "The ground decides what is real. The chair has lived it.",
      "prev": "bee56c2a7fc3b451085378c655cab25704ccc2c7add24bedd12c3394630b7757",
      "hash": "0566ed12a6d828cca56fa7ff72a2466c57f3f9db77da952a086700e4aaf5a05b"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "math",
      "body": "Count the rate, the expected value, and the tax before the move.",
      "prev": "0566ed12a6d828cca56fa7ff72a2466c57f3f9db77da952a086700e4aaf5a05b",
      "hash": "4c548a5a33577f4c6f1d0376bd6b5fdc3f11405e3043cbeccf5528648df2810b"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "How to Solve It",
      "body": "Name the unknown, list what is known, then take one step.",
      "prev": "4c548a5a33577f4c6f1d0376bd6b5fdc3f11405e3043cbeccf5528648df2810b",
      "hash": "e54d4211c49a871b9891d8ac3c07a99bd11ff2084d9857166a7b62a3393560e9"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "ai-agentic",
      "body": "An agent has a role, a tool, a memory, and a human gate. It does not invent a second product.",
      "prev": "e54d4211c49a871b9891d8ac3c07a99bd11ff2084d9857166a7b62a3393560e9",
      "hash": "5ad1c738b988f8b1bb09c0f7dc92ef7804184720a62094bc2e454ae5aa0f2398"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "market",
      "body": "Read the market in public. No live order and no token sale without the written AMF answer.",
      "prev": "5ad1c738b988f8b1bb09c0f7dc92ef7804184720a62094bc2e454ae5aa0f2398",
      "hash": "f4b73796814e4624acc1656b39ffb694c4508a124012065e0bb62a06789f42cf"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Trinity",
      "body": "Bring the agents that already exist, then the departments. One shared brain. One runner. One desk. One commercial model.",
      "prev": "f4b73796814e4624acc1656b39ffb694c4508a124012065e0bb62a06789f42cf",
      "hash": "f5935ae3e78bf35f890c5e4e9083af029fee4ab90f5c72ccf7529a7010fe2050"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "section": "core",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "The Psychology of Money",
      "body": "Time in the position beats a clever trade. The ledger stays internal.",
      "prev": "f5935ae3e78bf35f890c5e4e9083af029fee4ab90f5c72ccf7529a7010fe2050",
      "hash": "012813b566dc15d698312746797a109ea75b07b894f4718898a92748d476d816"
    },
